<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's Gold Corp gold output at 143.6/tn.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's Gold Corp gold output at 143.6/tn.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold Corp, Australia's largest refiner, said on Friday it produced 143.6 tonnes of fine gold and 42.2 tonnes of fine silver in 1995/96 (July-June), which it valued at A$2.2 billion.</p>
<p>The company, which operates the Perth Mint, did not provide comparable figures.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
